                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "In this video I take a look at eXplosive Dinosaurs a party game full of mini games to play with your friends.\nI tried it in single player, not ideal but it gives you a look at the game play it offers.\nInitially you are offered four mystery mini games and as you complete them you are offered another range and so on. As they are unlocked they become available for direct selection from the main menu. \nThe games are very simple and usually set to a small timer to keep the game moving and fun. It's ultimately about fun with friends so the games are usually whimsical so any level of gamer can enjoy them.\nWatch the video to see what the game is like.....\nhttps://youtu.be/DNfv3nXGhpE\nCheck'n Games, providing you with as many Let's Play's as we can.\nThanks for watching. Please like comment and subscribe.",
